title: "SATCP: Secant–Approximate-Tangent Curvature Predictor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liu"
    given-names: "Fan"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and legacy FEniCS implementations of the
  secant–approximate-tangent curvature predictor for arc-length tracing
  of geometrically nonlinear equilibrium paths, together with two shell
  benchmark drivers.
keywords:
  - "arc-length method"
  - "path following"
  - "geometric nonlinearity"
  - "postbuckling"
  - "curvature predictor"
  - "finite element method"
